<!--
  Launcher foreground for the `gasoline` variant, referenced from
  app-variants.yaml as `icon.vector`. A fuel nozzle laid over a stack of coins:
  the amber coins carry the shape, the steel nozzle names the subject.

  Converted from the site's 1536x1456 SVG. The artwork's bounding box is
  96.5,67.4 1366.5x1305.2, so the group scales it by 0.037322 (51 units on
  its long side) and centres it on 54,54 - inside the 66-unit safe zone that an
  adaptive-icon mask never clips. Gradient coordinates stay in the original SVG
  space because the group transform applies to the shader as well.

  The SVG masks the coins with an eroded copy of themselves to widen the gaps
  between them; vector drawables have no masks, so that step is dropped. The
  coin outlines are part of the path itself, so they survive - the gaps are
  merely a little tighter than on the web page.
-->
